## ⚡ n8n Multi-Setup – Version 2.6.3 Update (Python + Node 20)

📄 This section documents updates for the **latest n8n version 2.6.3**, including a **custom Docker image with Node.js 20** and **Python 3.9 (virtualenv)**. Workflows that require advanced Python logic can now run directly inside n8n.

✨ **Key Changes from Previous Version:**

* **n8n Version:** 2.6.3
* **Node.js:** 20.x (required by n8n 2.6.3)
* **Python:** 3.9 + virtualenv + pip + common libraries
* **Custom Image:** n8n-custom:2.6.3
* Updated **Dockerfile** to use Node 20 and create Python virtual environment
* All previously supported PostgreSQL & LDAP configurations remain the same

---

### Custom Dockerfile (Python-enabled + Node 20)

```Dockerfile
FROM node:20-bullseye-slim

USER root

RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
    python3 \
    python3-pip \
    python3-venv \
    build-essential \
    curl \
    git \
    ca-certificates \
    libffi-dev \
    libssl-dev \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

RUN python3 -m venv /opt/venv
ENV PATH="/opt/venv/bin:$PATH"

RUN pip install --upgrade pip setuptools wheel

RUN pip install \
    requests \
    urllib3 \
    httpx \
    pandas \
    numpy \
    scipy \
    pydantic \
    python-dateutil \
    pytz \
    python-dotenv \
    tenacity \
    rich \
    loguru \
    jsonschema \
    lxml \
    beautifulsoup4 \
    xmltodict \
    openpyxl \
    xlrd \
    sqlalchemy \
    psycopg2-binary \
    redis \
    boto3 \
    cryptography \
    pyjwt

RUN npm install -g n8n@2.6.3

USER node
EXPOSE 5678
CMD ["n8n"]
```

---

### Docker Compose Notes

* Image name updated to `n8n-custom:2.6.3`
* Node 20 + Python 3.9 included in the image
* All previous environment variables (`.env`) and LDAP/PostgreSQL setups remain unchanged
* Build and run:

```bash
docker compose build --no-cache n8n
docker compose up -d
```

